      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your words paint a vivid picture of the crushing weight of failure, where even the sun’s arrival holds no meaning in the aftermath of lost ambition. In this break, I suggest you channel that silence not into despair, but to carefully tend to your wounds so you might eventually stand against the next morning. The story didn't end; it simply paused, giving you the rare chance to decide if the next chapter is worth writing yourself.",
