    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not a pause though. It's just empty. The silence is too loud. I look at my sword, the one I've carried through every battle... and it's the only thing that doesn't feel like a lie right now. It's the only thing left that's honest. It feels like it's waiting for me to finally do something that actually matters, instead of just drifting through these ruins.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
